xm8b N005 Vbias4 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={W_xm8b} l={L_xm8b}

* Compensation and Load (Fig 24.8)
Cc N002 vout 1.5p
CL vout 0 1p

* Baker Fig 24.9 Open-Loop AC Simulation Setup
* DC operating point maintained by large feedback network
RF vout vm 100MEG
